cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SARGENT, please cite the manuscript given under
  preferred-citation; to cite a specific version of the software, cite it
  as below.
type: software
title: "SARGENT: Sparse ARG-based ENcoding of Traits"
abstract: >-
  SARGENT fits Bayesian sparse linear mixed models for complex traits that
  combine effects of typed SNPs with a random effect derived from an
  ancestral recombination graph (ARG), capturing heritability from variants
  that are untyped or poorly tagged by the typed SNPs.
